# The income arm of the impincome96 panel: the standing base
# evolve3-g3m10 with income_ladder ON -- a refused tier-three extractor
# conversion saves toward itself, the one credit lever the ledger frontier
# lists as unmeasured at Impossible (upgrade:extractorT3 asked 733-2,028
# times per match at this rung and never once funded). Every other line
# is byte-identical to the base; the paired survival delta against it is
# the whole measurement.
name stand-ladder
